rameter can&#39;t be negative or under 10 seconds. Can contain Tokens. &quot;},&quot;Placeholder&quot;:{},&quot;DefaultValue&quot;:{},&quot;Default&quot;:null,&quot;Type&quot;:&quot;Text&quot;,&quot;IsPublic&quot;:false,&quot;Settings&quot;:{},&quot;Validation&quot;:[],&quot;Groups&quot;:null,&quot;Parameters&quot;:[],&quot;Conditions&quot;:[]},{&quot;For&quot;:null,&quot;NotFor&quot;:null,&quot;Id&quot;:&quot;SqlQuery&quot;,&quot;Title&quot;:{&quot;default&quot;:&quot;SQL Query&quot;},&quot;HelpText&quot;:{&quot;default&quot;:&quot;SQL to execute. Can contain Tokens. &amp;lt;br/&amp;gt; &amp;lt;div style=\&quot;color:red\&quot;&amp;gt;WARNING!&amp;lt;/div&amp;gt; We encourage using binding parameters instead of using the tokens directly on sql query. Just use @param instead of [token] and bind below values as shown: Parameter Name: param ; Parameter Value: [token]. This will keep your database safe.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;&quot;},&quot;Placeholder&quot;:{},&quot;DefaultValue&quot;:{},&quot;Default&quot;:null,&quot;Type&quot;:&quot;Code&quot;,&quot;IsPublic&quot;:false,&quot;Settings&quot;:{&quot;CodeMirrorMode&quot;:&quot;sql&quot;,&quot;AiAssist&quot;:&quot;sql&quot;},&quot;Validation&quot;:[{&quot;Type&quot;:&quot;Required&quot;,&quot;From&quot;:null,&quot;For&quot;:null,&quot;Settings&quot;:{}}],&quot;Groups&quot;:null,&quot;Parameters&quot;:[],&quot;Conditions&quot;:[]},{&quot;For&quot;:null,&quot;NotFor&quot;:null,&quot;Id&quot;:&quot;BindTokens&quot;,&quot;Title&quot;:{&quot;default&quot;:&quot;Bind Tokens&quot;},&quot;HelpText&quot;:{&quot;default&quot;:&quot;Bind the parameters above with a value or token. e.g. P. Name:param, P. Value:[token] &quot;},&quot;Placeholder&quot;:{},&quot;DefaultValue&quot;:{},&quot;Default&quot;:null,&quot;Type&quot;:&quot;NameValueCollection&quot;,&quot;IsPublic&quot;:false,&quot;Settings&quot;:{&quot;NameColumn&quot;:&quot;Parameter Name&quot;,&quot;ValueColumn&quot;:&quot;Parameter Value&quot;,&quot;ButtonName&quot;:&quot;Bind mor